What is reused: the wording of the settings page in desktop/plugin.js (button
names, status labels, toasts, confirmation texts such as "Fits your GPU",
"Unified memory", "Set up for me", "Let me choose"), taken from Hermes Desktop's
Settings → Providers → Local Models page so that the two pages read the same,
