files are not in this repository. The plugin downloads a build of ds4 (made by
this repository's GitHub workflow from ds4's source at a pinned commit; every
such archive carries ds4's LICENSE, a NOTICE, and the notices of the parts
compiled into ds4-server: see .github/engine-NOTICE.txt), or fetches ds4's
